  /* A KIT LINE NEVER OUTLIVES ITS CONSOLE (2026-09-21, owner: "make sure ...
     the prices stay correct, like if they add or delete items"). The
     Protection Kit is free only beside a Max console (the admin's Max Kit
     Free discount), so when a Max leaves the cart its kit line would turn
     into a paid $49.97 one. Kit units beyond one per Max console are taken
     out, and the cart is read again before anything is painted. The three
     add-on products are never touched: they are paid items either way. */
  var trimming = false;
